# Task center board: machine-local WORKING STATE, not source. Committing it would
# let it drift between branches and manufacture the very merge conflicts the task
# center exists to prevent. What gets versioned here is the proposals and skills
# under .agents/, which are the artefacts worth reviewing.
.agents/tasks.json
